{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-20T04:22:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112398908156772575"],"id":"2112398908156772575","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":250,"impression_count":39891,"like_count":288,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":28},"text":"https://t.co/eThHuh7dof\n把大富翁4重制的联机功能做好了。\n确定性锁步同步，WebRTC链接方式。\n只要设备能连网，运行派对模式，\n就可以让自己的手机变成服务器。\n加进来参与游戏的人，每个人的手机都可以成为服务器。玩急眼了可以投票踢人，由于大家每个人手机都有区块，所以就连房主也可以踢。\nios https://t.co/ZYGsym9J1X","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2112398908156772575"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:47:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112360145573548058"],"id":"2112360145573548058","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21877,"like_count":23,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我感觉claude最烦人的地方就是，\n他开发着开发着就开始一直说英文了，\n你必须要强制让他讲中文，\n他才会纠正过来。😒 https://t.co/WAeymkwmaQ","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2112360145573548058"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-19T12:16:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112156031484821640"],"id":"2112156031484821640","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":75642,"like_count":161,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"text":"能看出日本物价上涨的厉害了，\n大久保公园居然都有三万日元的了…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2112156031484821640"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-19T10:04:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112122689381081380"],"id":"2112122689381081380","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":121,"impression_count":27534,"like_count":141,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":18},"text":"新模式做好了😂 开始有点好玩了。\nhttps://t.co/ibJidUWWjV https://t.co/AsdmAHxCnr","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2112122689381081380"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-19T04:47:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112042973076889904"],"id":"2112042973076889904","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":31,"impression_count":38814,"like_count":108,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":1},"text":"在日本的大手公司是不一样啊，\n入职居然还有礼仪课…\n我以为培训一天就结束了，\n结果是每次培训3小时，\n一共要培训10节课…😂 https://t.co/yNJfjpS0Lo","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2112042973076889904"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-18T05:18:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111688402240508355"],"id":"2111688402240508355","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":21843,"like_count":75,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":1},"text":"跟AI交流久了，\n就更不喜欢和人类打交道了，\n有好多人见面聊两句，\n发现智商不够真的让人很恼火。🙂‍↕️","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2111688402240508355"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-18T04:50:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111681272682840253"],"id":"2111681272682840253","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":22621,"like_count":78,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"本来一堆事要忙，\n结果为了看他到底能睡到啥时候，\n我已经在山手线上坐了一圈了… https://t.co/ijhWWC2J5g","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2111681272682840253"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-17T14:01:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111457482665345435"],"id":"2111457482665345435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":16753,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110618564608880843","type":"quoted"}],"text":"https://t.co/KTMugAgdW6\n有时间帮我测试一下吧。 https://t.co/d1vhXwP9ER","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2111457482665345435"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-17T11:56:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111426191844675858"],"id":"2111426191844675858","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":11839,"like_count":29,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又到吃螃蟹的季节了… https://t.co/AGtlItpakF","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2111426191844675858"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:32:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110921811181617654"],"id":"2110921811181617654","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":16837,"like_count":45,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110618564608880843","type":"quoted"}],"text":"让Claude根据原来的地图逻辑，\n生成了两张新地图，tokyo和Osaka\n我再想是不是可以加入地图编辑器模式，\n就可以让所有人自制地图，\n像马里奥制造一样，\n分享自己的大富翁地图了。 https://t.co/SXz0X8pCF1 https://t.co/d1vhXwP9ER","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2110921811181617654"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:06:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110688838859248093"],"id":"2110688838859248093","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1179,"impression_count":136504,"like_count":1310,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":66,"retweet_count":108},"text":"很多人说用Claude和codex等工具调用rea反编译的时候，会被AI道德拒绝。\n我是用本地模型调用，\n先逆向建一个GitHub的源码库，\n加壳的应用甚至可以直接帮你脱壳。\n然后跟Claude或是Codex说我写了一个程序，你来帮我优化一下…\n他们就开始卖命工作了。\n这个逻辑和做生意一样，\n先靠擦边灰产赚到第一笔钱，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2110688838859248093"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-15T09:51:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110669872774689085"],"id":"2110669872774689085","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":16617,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110618564608880843","type":"quoted"}],"text":"我做几个新地图，加几个新玩法，然后就开源到github https://t.co/d1vhXwP9ER","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2110669872774689085"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-15T06:27:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110618564608880843"],"id":"2110618564608880843","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":321,"impression_count":148883,"like_count":623,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":72,"retweet_count":49},"text":"REA研究了一天，\n把经典的大富翁4逆向了，\n然后花了一天时间，\n让claude用flutter重新跑了一个全新的出来。\n编译到iPhone上，发现完成度还是很高的。\n现在重制复刻经典游戏变得越来越简单了。 https://t.co/Fmw8DOr00e","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2110618564608880843"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-15T04:23:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110587426037256495"],"id":"2110587426037256495","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":17395,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":3},"text":"研究了几个H3的替换角色的lora。\n写了一个自动识别剧中角色，\n然后指定角色设定卡来替换角色的工作流，\n玩的我实在太上头了。 https://t.co/7GcZ95MGgs","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2110587426037256495"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:48:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110201077039861802"],"id":"2110201077039861802","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":123,"impression_count":63996,"like_count":469,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":55,"retweet_count":13},"text":"真心劝刚来的留学生好好学日语，\n工作后你会发现，\n当你和同事的能力差不多，\n甚至同事的能力比你强的时候，\n日语说的好，工资就会高出很多。\n英语也好好学，\n当你日语英语说的都好，\n工资还会高。\n而且AI时代哪还有什么能力一说，\n就剩沟通了，\n能把不同语种的需求沟通明白了，\n那你就能赚到钱了啊…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2110201077039861802"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:47:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109883720408986075"],"id":"2109883720408986075","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":75,"impression_count":30333,"like_count":95,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109880354878480886","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这个lora简直太适合做模卡检索网站了😂\n以后交友网站都可以用这个去搞啊。\n玩了一下午这个真心太有意思了。 https://t.co/4yYz6d821Q https://t.co/YflzoUdt57","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2109883720408986075"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:34:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109880354878480886"],"id":"2109880354878480886","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":70,"impression_count":68684,"like_count":137,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":3},"text":"最近那个360度环绕的lora不是很火吗？\n我就尝试着做了一个360度查看模卡的网站，\n给会员频道的会员试用一下，\n感觉不错的话，\n以后可以这样发布资料了🤣 https://t.co/TNGB3IjDBs","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2109880354878480886"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:26:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109863330404020285"],"id":"2109863330404020285","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":52,"impression_count":55325,"like_count":105,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":7},"text":"大阪的活人感真的很强啊…😂 https://t.co/drd56XYNaM","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2109863330404020285"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-12T11:43:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109610896117137734"],"id":"2109610896117137734","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":30395,"like_count":103,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":74,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在日本上班还是挺舒服的，\n我之前的生活就是每天睡到自然醒，\n然后在家里躺到晚上午饭都不吃，\n生活作息很不规律。\n现在好了，\n睡到自然醒后，去公司坐一会。\n然后准时吃午饭，\n下班还能准时吃晚饭。\n每天上个五六个小时的班，\n感觉整个人精神状态好了很多。\n我甚至现在放假在家都感觉特别空虚…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2109610896117137734"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-11T03:31:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109124692997186045"],"id":"2109124692997186045","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":33363,"like_count":89,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"公司招了日本人运营团队运营SNS，\n发一个帖子居然要集体内容审核，\n然后要四个工作日才能发出去…\n他们问我应该招什么人做SNS最合适，\n我说你招几个中国20岁左右的年轻人，\n绝对比你们会搞流量…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2109124692997186045"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-10T02:34:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108748024445125097"],"id":"2108748024445125097","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":140989,"like_count":355,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":1},"text":"国内来了一个老板，\n跟我刚来日本带我混的大哥打听我，\n问我大哥认不认识梁哥。\n我那大哥都懵了，就问啥时候出了个梁哥。\n老板把我推特给他看，\n他才说，这不是小梁吗？\n然后一个电话给我，\n我就屁颠屁颠的随叫随到了😂","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2108748024445125097"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-09T01:19:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108366640308232430"],"id":"2108366640308232430","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":57793,"like_count":112,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":0},"text":"年初某人就让我定投okb，\n结果我老老实实的每天100美金定投到现在，\n翻倍了，\n我问她是不是也赚了不少吧，\n结果她说她压根没买!!？？？？？","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2108366640308232430"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-08T05:45:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108071342415192563"],"id":"2108071342415192563","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":32678,"like_count":58,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":6},"text":"研究了一周AI短剧，算是磕磕绊绊的试着做出来了一集，\n确实太费时间了，\n尤其是你想要的镜头效果他生成不出来的时候越弄越生气。\n长镜头调度，正反打镜头，空间约束还是差点意思。不该越轴乱越轴。\n必须要反复调整关键词还要喂大量的图片参考。\n但有一说一看到由代码变成视频的感觉还是挺让人激动的。 https://t.co/hUW1A8jCTG","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2108071342415192563"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-07T03:53:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107680681442836655"],"id":"2107680681442836655","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":47807,"like_count":152,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":3},"text":"年轻时候到处撩女孩子，\n各种社交软件各种滑，\n各种跟妹子谈感情，谈理想。\n为了打个炮啥不要脸的恶心话都能说出来。\n\n岁数大了以后到处躲女孩子，\n社交软件只剩tg，\n跟女孩子不谈感情只谈钱。\n如果没办法带女孩子赚到钱，\n基本不会跟女孩子见面的。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2107680681442836655"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-06T09:56:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107409564530520239"],"id":"2107409564530520239","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":28692,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近来公司面试做自媒体的人，\n从头到尾一直在给我讲算法，\n一点内容方面的都不讲啊…\n现在的自媒体都不追求内容了吗？","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2107409564530520239"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-15T06:27:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110618564608880843"],"id":"2110618564608880843","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":321,"impression_count":148883,"like_count":623,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":72,"retweet_count":49},"text":"REA研究了一天，\n把经典的大富翁4逆向了，\n然后花了一天时间，\n让claude用flutter重新跑了一个全新的出来。\n编译到iPhone上，发现完成度还是很高的。\n现在重制复刻经典游戏变得越来越简单了。 https://t.co/Fmw8DOr00e"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:34:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109880354878480886"],"id":"2109880354878480886","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":70,"impression_count":68684,"like_count":137,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":3},"text":"最近那个360度环绕的lora不是很火吗？\n我就尝试着做了一个360度查看模卡的网站，\n给会员频道的会员试用一下，\n感觉不错的话，\n以后可以这样发布资料了🤣 https://t.co/TNGB3IjDBs"}],"users":[{"id":"222316578","name":"梁","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772826334999502848/ZdX2uBog_normal.jpg","username":"iam678","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2112398908156772575","next_token":"7140dibdnow9c7btwp0fs6rr80z6uvri82i2o8yey58ah","oldest_id":"2107409564530520239","previous_token":"77qpymm88g5h9vqkmfprnh84qnbuhmf0l4yxnoipcakol","result_count":25}}